## OVERCOOKED GAME MECHANICS - MIXED SOUPS WITH CHOPPING (ONION + TOMATO)

### State Variables:
- onion_hand ∈ {none, agent, partner} - Who is holding the raw onion
- chopped_onion_hand ∈ {none, agent, partner} - Who is holding the chopped onion
- onion_staged ∈ {true, false} - Is raw onion staged/placed somewhere accessible  
- chopped_onion_staged ∈ {true, false} - Is chopped onion staged/placed somewhere accessible
- onion_at_chopping ∈ {true, false} - Is raw onion at chopping station
- chopped_onion_at_chopping ∈ {true, false} - Is chopped onion at chopping station
- tomato_hand ∈ {none, agent, partner} - Who is holding the raw tomato
- chopped_tomato_hand ∈ {none, agent, partner} - Who is holding the chopped tomato
- tomato_staged ∈ {true, false} - Is raw tomato staged/placed somewhere accessible
- chopped_tomato_staged ∈ {true, false} - Is chopped tomato staged/placed somewhere accessible
- tomato_at_chopping ∈ {true, false} - Is raw tomato at chopping station
- chopped_tomato_at_chopping ∈ {true, false} - Is chopped tomato at chopping station
- onion_in_pot ∈ {true, false} - Is raw or chopped onion placed in cooking pot
- tomato_in_pot ∈ {true, false} - Is raw or chopped tomato placed in cooking pot
- soup_cooking ∈ {true, false} - Is soup actively cooking (ticker >= 1)
- soup_ready ∈ {true, false} - Is soup ready to serve
- soup_hand ∈ {none, agent, partner} - Who is holding the soup
- soup_staged ∈ {true, false} - Is soup staged/placed somewhere accessible
- soup_in_pot_not_cooking ∈ {true, false} - Is soup in pot but not cooking (ticker = -1)
- dish_hand ∈ {none, agent, partner} - Who is holding the dish
- dish_staged ∈ {true, false} - Is dish staged/placed somewhere accessible
- soup_served ∈ {true, false} - Is soup delivered to serving station

### Valid Action Sequences:
1. FetchOnion → [StageOnion OR PlaceOnionAtChopping] → [Optional: PickupChoppedOnion] → [Optional: StageChoppedOnion] → FetchTomato → [StageTomato OR PlaceTomatoAtChopping] → [Optional: PickupChoppedTomato] → [Optional: StageChoppedTomato] → TurnStoveOn → WaitForSoupToCook → soup_ready=true
2. FetchDish → StageDish → FetchSoup → StageSoup → ServeSoup → soup_served=true

### Transition Rules:
- FetchOnion: onion_hand=none → onion_hand=agent (from dispenser)
- StageOnion: onion_hand=agent → onion_hand=none, onion_staged=true (to staging)
- PlaceOnionAtChopping: onion_hand=agent → onion_hand=none, onion_at_chopping=true → chopped_onion_at_chopping=true (automatic transformation)
- PickupChoppedOnion: chopped_onion_at_chopping=true → chopped_onion_hand=agent, chopped_onion_at_chopping=false (from chopping)
- StageChoppedOnion: chopped_onion_hand=agent → chopped_onion_hand=none, chopped_onion_staged=true (to staging)
- FetchTomato: tomato_hand=none → tomato_hand=agent (from dispenser)
- StageTomato: tomato_hand=agent → tomato_hand=none, tomato_staged=true (to staging)
- PlaceTomatoAtChopping: tomato_hand=agent → tomato_hand=none, tomato_at_chopping=true → chopped_tomato_at_chopping=true (automatic transformation)
- PickupChoppedTomato: chopped_tomato_at_chopping=true → chopped_tomato_hand=agent, chopped_tomato_at_chopping=false (from chopping)
- StageChoppedTomato: chopped_tomato_hand=agent → chopped_tomato_hand=none, chopped_tomato_staged=true (to staging)
- PlaceInPot: onion_hand=partner OR chopped_onion_hand=partner OR tomato_hand=partner OR chopped_tomato_hand=partner → onion_in_pot=true OR tomato_in_pot=true
- Cooking & TurnStoveOn: soup_in_pot_not_cooking=true → soup_cooking=true (automatic)
- Ready: soup_cooking=true → soup_ready=true (automatic)
- FetchSoup: soup_ready=true, soup_hand=none → soup_hand=agent
- StageSoup: soup_hand=agent → soup_hand=none, soup_staged=true
- FetchDish: dish_hand=none → dish_hand=agent
- StageDish: dish_hand=agent → dish_hand=none, dish_staged=true
- ServeSoup: soup_staged=true → soup_hand=agent → soup_served=true

### Preconditions:
- Can only place onion in pot if holding onion (raw or chopped)
- Can only place tomato in pot if holding tomato (raw or chopped)
- Can only fetch soup if soup_ready=true
- Can only serve soup if soup_staged=true
- Both ingredients must be in pot before cooking can begin
- Can only pickup chopped ingredient if chopped ingredient is at chopping station
- Chopping happens automatically when raw ingredients are placed at chopping stations

### Secondary Actions:
- pickup(onion): Handles raw onion acquisition from dispenser
- pickup(tomato): Handles raw tomato acquisition from dispenser
- pickup(chopped_onion): Handles chopped onion acquisition from chopping station
- pickup(chopped_tomato): Handles chopped tomato acquisition from chopping station
- pickup(dish): Handles dish acquisition from dispenser
- pickup(soup): Handles soup acquisition from soup staging
- place(onion, chopping_station): Places raw onion at chopping station (auto-chops)
- place(onion, staging_station): Places raw onion at staging station
- place(tomato, chopping_station): Places raw tomato at chopping station (auto-chops)
- place(tomato, staging_station): Places raw tomato at staging station
- place(chopped_onion): Places chopped onion at staging station
- place(chopped_tomato): Places chopped tomato at staging station
- place(dish): Places dish at dish staging station
- place(soup): Places soup at serving station
- NOOP: No secondary action needed

